addressbook><name>MURASATO MASAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NGK INSULATORS LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HISHIKI, TATSUYA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISOMURA, MANABU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ITO, MAKOTO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOMODA, TADANORI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MURASATO, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NGK INSULATORS, LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HISHIKI TATSUYA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISOMURA MANABU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ITO MAKOTO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOMODA TADANORI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MURASATO MASAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HISHIKI, TATSUYA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISOMURA, MANABU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ITO, MAKOTO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOMODA, TADANORI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MURASATO, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A method for manufacturing a filter having a ceramic porous film as a separating film which comprises the steps of filling pores of a porous substrate (1) with a liquid, segregating gas-tightly a face of the porous substrate (1) to have a separating film thereon from a face thereof not to have a film, feeding a slurry (9) containing aggregate particles comprising ceramics for forming a film continuously to the face to have a separating film thereon to contact the slurry with the face, and then rendering the two faces to have a filtration pressure difference, to thereby form a film from the slurry on a surface of the porous substrate, wherein an organic polymer is added to the slurry for imparting filtration resistance to a film layer thus formed. The method can be used for forming a porous film which has a uniform thickness, a smooth surface and besides a sharp pore diameter distribution.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un procédé de fabrication d'un filtre comportant un film céramique poreux comme film de séparation. Le procédé consiste à remplir les pores d'un substrat poreux (1) avec un liquide, à séparer une face du substrat poreux (1) pour la rendre étanche aux gaz afin d'y disposer un film de séparation de sorte qu'une face du substrat soit dépourvue de film. Le procédé consiste ensuite à alimenter une suspension épaisse (9) contenant des particules agrégées comprenant de la céramique en vue de former en continu un film sur la face pour amener un film de séparation disposé sur cette face à mettre celle-ci au contact de la suspension épaisse. Le procédé consiste enfin enduire les deux faces pour obtenir une différence de pression de filtration permettant de former avec la suspension épaisse un film sur une face du substrat poreux, un polymère organique étant ajouté à la suspension épaisse pour conférer une résistance de filtration à une couche de film ainsi formée. Ce procédé peut être utilisé pour former un film poreux présentant une épaisseur uniforme, une surface lisse et une distribution sensible du diamètre des pores.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>